l3: Check the function bodies in router_info

enable_radvd() now raises a RuntimeError naming radvd if it runs before
initialize() has created the monitor, rather than an AttributeError on
None. RouterInfo declares host as None, since only DVR routers set it
and only they have centralized floating IPs to compare it with.

